request apart v1 "Tool request"
description "A stage due by the office's days and reminded by the plant's (fictional rules): the reminder of the ones it goes up to is counted in the plant's calendar too"

use organization org from "../../examples/shared/company.ringi"
use calendar office from "../../examples/shared/office.cal"
use calendar plant from "plant.cal"

form
  what : text "What"  count >=1 <=100

route
  decide  manager

who
  manager = manager of requester
  board   = team board

every stage
  due in 2 business days in office at end of day
  remind after 1 business day in plant at 09:00
  when late escalate, then escalate
  when empty escalate, then board

ticket
  self approval  not allowed

claims
  reminded_in_time : every stage reminds before it is due

# submitted on a Friday. The plant opens on Saturday, so the reminder goes on Saturday morning, and
# the stage is due at the end of Tuesday. It goes up on Wednesday: the one it goes up to is reminded
# on the plant's next business day, Thursday, and is due at the end of Friday. It goes up again on
# Saturday: the plant closes on Sunday and Monday, so the reminder goes on Tuesday morning, the day
# the stage is due
scenario late_and_up_twice
  requester e1201
  form what = "A drill"
| at               | event  | by | -> stage | status      |
| 2026-11-13 10:00 | submit | e1201 | decide | in progress |
| 2026-11-14 09:00 | remind |    | decide   | in progress |
| 2026-11-18 00:00 | late   |    | decide   | in progress |
| 2026-11-19 09:00 | remind |    | decide   | in progress |
| 2026-11-21 00:00 | late   |    | decide   | in progress |
| 2026-11-24 09:00 | remind |    | decide   | in progress |
| 2026-11-25 00:00 | late   |    |          | expired     |
